# Qualification image context. BuildKit reads this file for
# app/qualification/Dockerfile instead of the root .dockerignore, so the
# service image's context is unchanged. Explicit allowlist: every source
# compiled into the cfg(test) library test executable, the catalog/migration
# resources and RDS CA it embeds, the contract files its tests embed, the
# supervisor, the runtime helper and its lock. Never credentials, evidence,
# caches, build output or operator state.
**
!app/qualification/Dockerfile
!app/qualification/Dockerfile.dockerignore
!app/Cargo.toml
!app/Cargo.lock
!app/src/lib.rs
!app/src/config.rs
!app/src/readiness.rs
!app/src/roles.rs
!app/src/auth_qualification.rs
!app/src/auth_qualification/tests.rs
